## Exercise catalog

The system exercise catalog derives from [Free Exercise DB](https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db).

- Licence: Unlicense (public domain dedication)
- Pinned revision: `b0eed061e1c832b3ed815fbaa4b45b3cdc14df49`
- Source records reviewed: 873; included: 709; excluded: 164
- Exclusions recorded individually in `apps/api/catalog/system-exercise-catalog-review.json`
- Instructions and media from the upstream dataset are not imported

Muscle mapping, equipment normalisation and classification adjustments applied
on import are original work and fall under the MIT licence.

